  {"deviation", "get population standard deviation of given collection of numbers", "Statistics", "function", 72, "https://github.com/arturo-lang/arturo/blob/v0.9.83/src/library/Statistics.nim#L72", "collection=block", "sample=logical:calculate the sample standard deviation", "floating", "arr:  [1 2 3 4]\narr2: [3 120 4 7 87 2 6 34]\n\nprint deviation arr         ; 1.118033988749895\nprint deviation arr2        ; 42.70959347734417\n\ndeviation.sample arr        ; => 1.290994448735806\ndeviation.sample arr2       ; => 45.65847597731914", "name address type description module args attrs returns example line source ", "get population standard deviation of\ngiven collection of numbers", "", "samplecalculate the sample standard deviation", "          usage  deviation collection :block", "        returns  :floating", ""},
