ype", "", "formatuse given format (for datesor floating-point numbers)unituse given unit (for quantities)intrepidconvert to bytecode without error-line trackinghslconvert HSL block to colorhsvconvert HSV block to color", "          usage  to type :type :block\n                    value :any", "        returns  :any", ""},
